Warner Home Video also released another DVD set titled ''Justice League: The Complete Series''. It contained all 91 episodes of ''Justice League'' and ''Justice League Unlimited'' on a 15-disc set with the 15th disc containing a bonus documentary. The same episodes were later sold as a 10-disc set without the bonus documentary.
===Streaming===

In September 2018, ''Justice League Unlimited'' and its predecessor series ''Justice League'' was made available for streaming online on the [[DC Universe (streaming service)|DC Universe]] streaming service that lasted until January 2021, when it was replaced by DC Universe Infinite (for digital comics only), with video content (including the series) moved to [[HBO Max]].

On March 1, 2026, ''Justice League Unlimited'' and its predecessor series ''Justice League'' was one of the 100 Warner Bros.-owned animated series that added to the [[Fox Corporation]]-owned [[Free ad-supported streaming television|FAST]]/AVOD  streaming service [[Tubi]].<ref>{{cite news|url=https://dcanimated.com/2026/02/dc-cartoons-joining-tubi-march-1|title=Classic DC Comics Cartoons Join Tubi March 1|website=The World's Finest|access-date=March 10, 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|last=Lang|first=Jamie|url=https://www.cartoonbrew.com/streaming/tubi-warner-bros-library-100-titles-258918.html|title=Tubi To Add 100 Warner Bros. Animated Titles Starting March 1|website=Cartoon Brew|date=February 17, 2026|access-date=March 10, 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.forbes.com/sites/sabrinareed/2026/02/17/cartoon-network-shows-removed-from-hbo-max-find-new-streaming-home|title=Tubi To Add Cartoon Network Shows Removed From HBO Max, Starting Next Month|magazine=[[Forbes]]|date=February 17, 2026|access-date=March 10, 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://cordcuttersnews.com/tubi-is-adding-classic-cartoon-network-shows-including-animaniacs-dexters-laboratory-more/|title=Tubi is Adding Classic Cartoon Network Shows Including Animaniacs, Dexter’s Laboratory, & More|website=Cord Cutters News|date=February 13, 2026|access-date=March 10, 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://comicbook.com/tv-shows/list/all-16-classic-animated-shows-you-can-now-watch-completely-free|title=All 16 Classic Animated Shows You Can Now Watch Completely Free|website=ComicBook.com|date=March 2, 2026|access-date=March 11, 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.ign.com/articles/tons-of-cartoon-network-and-warner-bros-shows-are-now-streaming-for-free-on-tubi|title=Tons of Cartoon Network and Warner Bros. shows are now streaming for free on Tubi|website=[[IGN]]|date=March 2, 2026|access-date=March 11, 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|last=Morgan|first=Katrina|url=https://www.wfaa.com/article/news/nation-world/tubi-classic-cartoons/507-8e1b2fff-5e6a-4f06-8fe5-a730d961ede8|title=Tubi adds dozens of classic cartoons to its free streaming lineup|website=[[WFAA]]|date=March 1, 2026|access-date=March 11, 2026}}</ref>

