===Justice League Infinity===
It is a sequel comic to ''Justice League Unlimited'', written by [[James Tucker (animator)|James Tucker]] and [[J.M. DeMatteis]] with art by [[Ethen Beavers]]. 7 numbered issues were published by DC Comics between 2021 and 2022.

